<title>GREECE: TABLE OF GREEK CENTRAL BANK FIXING RATES, SEPT 7.</title>
<headline>TABLE OF GREEK CENTRAL BANK FIXING RATES, SEPT 7.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1996-09-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Greece's fixing rates</p>
<p>for leading currencies on Monday were as follows.</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p> Currency:     Sept 7	Sept 6	 DEC 29 95    NET</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>- USD =	  238.010     237.040     237,040    0.41 %</p>
<p>- DEM =	  159.490     159.660     165.490   -3.63 %</p>
<p>- FRF =	   46.708	46.680	48.410   -3.52 %</p>
<p>- GBP =	  371.200     371.480     366.280    1.34 %</p>
<p>- CHF =	  195.700     196.510     206.030   -5.01 %</p>
<p>- NLG =	  142.285     142.425     147.886   -3.79 %</p>
<p>- ITL (100) =   15.739	15.700	14.975    5.10 %</p>
<p>- JPY (100) =  218.280     217.200     230.135   -5.15 %</p>
<p>- ECU =	  301.230     301.270     303.640   -0.79 %</p>
<p>- ESP =	    1.890	 1.889	 1.939   -2.53 %</p>
<p>- PTE =	    1.558	 1.558	 1.575   -1.08 %</p>
<p>Note: The percentage net change is calculated as the percentage</p>
<p>difference between the most recent fixing rate and the December</p>
<p>29, 1995 rate.</p>
<p>--Dimitris Kontogiannis, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
</text>
